0000115A                           197  *-----------------------------------------------------------
0000115A                           198  * Subroutine    : Game
0000115A                           199  * Description   : Game including main GameLoop. GameLoop is like
0000115A                           200  * a while loop in that it runs forever until interupted
0000115A                           201  * (Input, Update, Draw). The Enemies Run at Player Jump to Avoid
0000115A                           202  *-----------------------------------------------------------
0000115A                           203  GAME:
0000115A  6100 02F0                204      BSR     PLAY_RUN                ; Play Run Wav
0000115E                           205  GAMELOOP:
0000115E                           206      ; Main Gameloop
0000115E  6100 0014                207      BSR     INPUT                   ; Check Keyboard Input
00001162  6100 0056                208      BSR     UPDATE                  ; Update positions and points
00001166  6100 0248                209      BSR     IS_PLAYER_ON_GND        ; Check if player is on ground
0000116A  6100 0404                210      BSR     CHECK_COLLISIONS        ; Check for Collisions
0000116E  6100 0192                211      BSR     DRAW                    ; Draw the Scene
00001172  60EA                     212      BRA     GAMELOOP                ; Loop back to GameLoop
00001174                           213  
