00001192                           233  * Subroutine    : Process Input
00001192                           234  * Description   : Branch based on keys pressed
00001192                           235  *-----------------------------------------------------------
00001192                           236  PROCESS_INPUT:
00001192  23C2 00001862            237      MOVE.L  D2,         CURRENT_KEY ; Put Current Key in Memory
00001198  0CB9 0000001B 00001862   238      CMP.L   #ESCAPE,    CURRENT_KEY ; Is Current Key Escape
000011A2  6700 059C                239      BEQ     EXIT                    ; Exit if Escape
000011A6  0CB9 00000020 00001862   240      CMP.L   #SPACEBAR,  CURRENT_KEY ; Is Current Key Spacebar
000011B0  6700 024C                241      BEQ     JUMP                    ; Jump
000011B4  6000 027E                242      BRA     IDLE                    ; Or Idle
000011B8  4E75                     243      RTS                             ; Return to subroutine
